# ========================================
# Nuxt Backend API Test Suite
# ========================================

# ========================================
# Hello API Tests
# ========================================

### GET /api/hello - Basic Request
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hello

### GET /api/hello - With Accept Header
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hello
Accept: application/json

### GET /api/hello - With Authorization Header
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hello
Authorization: Bearer test-token
Content-Type: application/json

### OPTIONS /api/hello - CORS Preflight
OPTIONS http://localhost:8000/api/hello
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type

### POST /api/hello - Method Not Allowed Test
POST http://localhost:8000/api/hello
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### PUT /api/hello - Method Not Allowed Test
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/hello
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "test"
}

### DELETE /api/hello - Method Not Allowed Test
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/hello

# ========================================
# User API Tests
# ========================================

### GET /api/users - ユーザー一覧取得
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users

### GET /api/users/1 - 個別ユーザー取得（存在するユーザー）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users/1

### GET /api/users/2 - 個別ユーザー取得（存在するユーザー）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users/2

### GET /api/users/999 - 個別ユーザー取得（存在しないユーザー）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users/999

### GET /api/users/invalid - 個別ユーザー取得（無効なID）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users/invalid

### POST /api/users - ユーザー作成（正常）
POST http://localhost:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NewUser"
}

### POST /api/users - ユーザー作成（空の名前）
POST http://localhost:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### POST /api/users - ユーザー作成（名前なし）
POST http://localhost:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

# ========================================
# Alternative curl Commands (Reference)
# ========================================

# # ユーザー一覧取得
# curl http://localhost:8000/api/users
#
# # 個別ユーザー取得
# curl http://localhost:8000/api/users/1
#
# # ユーザー作成
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/users \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{"name": "NewUser"}'